                        "sense_id": "d7883975-e31d-3138-8c05-c2647096cce8",
                        "entry_id": "8187e9d0-5ac2-3d78-b80a-e957a544e7fc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Short, stumpy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c51cc1a6-aa3c-4d87-b80c-dd9116ad2d73",
                                "sense_id": "d7883975-e31d-3138-8c05-c2647096cce8",
                                "text": "Both have mottled legs,\nBoth have snubby noses,\nBoth have—Here the host\nKindly interposes:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9133d407-b0ba-4635-8811-1ae0fec8f8db",
                                "sense_id": "d7883975-e31d-3138-8c05-c2647096cce8",
                                "text": "Well, for more than five years that was me—an alert young chap with a round, pink, snubby kind of face and butter-coloured hair […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7aa61659-51e6-42f5-bb8d-1cd4f50c756b",
                                "sense_id": "d7883975-e31d-3138-8c05-c2647096cce8",
                                "text": "Armed with snubby flintlock and limber blade, Weaver does his crime busting in London during the second decade of the 18th century."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8557baf-f113-4894-9fbe-65611146d60c",
                                "sense_id": "d7883975-e31d-3138-8c05-c2647096cce8",
                                "text": "There was not much of it: the wheelbase was only ninety inches and the track precisely half of that, with a little cast-iron side-valve engine of 918cm² cowering in the depths beneath the snubby bonnet."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
